   "author_url": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/user/74544/idiotturdle",
   "created_at": "2025-04-06T07:11:16+00:00",
   "body_html": "<!--[if BLOCK]><![endif]-->            <p>In config.json. You set the itemPriceMultiplier to the value you want the base ammo price to be multiplied by.</p>\n<p>If you want cheapest set it to 0.01 and if you want base game price it should be 1 which is the default value.</p>\n\n        <!--[if ENDBLOCK]><![endif]-->",
